---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Providers & OAuth Browser Redirect" currentPath="/docs/guides/providers">
  <div class="space-y-8 font-mono text-xs">
    <div>
      <div class="text-[11px] text-zinc-400 font-semibold mb-1">INTEGRATIONS</div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-sans">Providers Hub & OAuth Browser Redirect</h1>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm font-sans mt-1">Connecting 347+ AI providers via OAuth 2.0 PKCE, API keys, and local daemons.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-[#111113] border border-[#222226] space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-sans">OAuth 2.0 PKCE One-Click Browser Connection</h2>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
        Clicking "Connect" on any OAuth provider (Google Gemini CLI, Kimi Code CLI, Amazon Q, Claude OAuth, OpenRouter PKCE) opens Chrome or Edge to the provider consent page and captures the callback on <code class="text-zinc-200">http://localhost:3001/v1/admin/providers/:id/oauth/callback</code>.
      </p>
      <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#18181b] border border-[#27272a] text-zinc-300">
        <div>• Access tokens encrypted with AES-256-GCM at rest</div>
        <div>• Automatic background rotation before expiry</div>
        <div>• CLI command: <code class="text-white">routenex auth login &lt;provider&gt;</code></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
